# c64-kb versions
#
# Bumped on specific kinds of change. Each version tracks one axis.
# See CHANGELOG.md for the human-readable history.
#
#   KB_DATA_VERSION   - bumps when docs/ content changes (any technique,
#                       recipe, pitfall, failure pattern, reference, or
#                       convention edit). Independent of ontology shape.
#
#   KB_SCHEMA_VERSION - bumps when the graph ontology changes (new node
#                       type, new edge type, field rename, mandatory
#                       field added). Forces a clean re-ingest.
#
#   MCP_TOOL_VERSION  - bumps on MCP tool surface changes per semver:
#                       major = breaking input/output schema change
#                       minor = new tool added
#                       patch = bug fix, no surface change
#
# Package version lives in package.json. Bump together with MCP_TOOL_VERSION
# when shipping.

KB_DATA_VERSION=794
KB_SCHEMA_VERSION=33
MCP_TOOL_VERSION=2.8.0
HVSC_CORPUS_VERSION=hvsc-84-2025-12-25
